{"id":"kreuz","lemma":"Kreuz","pos":"noun","rank":2053,"glosses":["cross","clubs","sharp sign, ♯"],"ipa":"/ˈkʁɔʏ̯ts/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/De-Kreuz.ogg/De-Kreuz.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Kreuzes","plural":"Kreuze"},"formAudio":{"Kreuzes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Kreuzes.wav","Kreuze":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Kreuze.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Bitte kreuze die richtige Antwort an.","en":"Please mark the correct answer.","words":[{"g":"please"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"correct","l":"richtig"},{"g":"answer"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Sie haben uns aufs Kreuz gelegt.","en":"They double-crossed us.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},null,null,{"g":"to lie down","l":"legen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe mir das Kreuz verrissen.","en":"I threw my back out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745830","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"the / that"},null,null]},{"text":"Das Rote Kreuz versorgte das Krankenhaus mit Blut.","en":"The Red Cross supplied the hospital with blood.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"red","l":"rot"},null,{"g":"to look after","l":"versorgen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"hospital"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"blood"}]},{"text":"Ich habe nicht versucht, Sie aufs Kreuz zu legen.","en":"I wasn't trying to trick you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to lie down"}]}]}